  "response": "**Files Changed:**\n- `src/main/java/com/example/demo/ProductService.java`\n\n**Reason for the Fix:**\nGitHub Issue #1 reported that filtering products by `maxPrice` was not working. Upon inspection, `ProductService.findProducts(...)` was ignoring the `maxPrice` parameter during stream filtering. We fixed this by adding a filter condition `.filter(product -> maxPrice == null || product.price() <= maxPrice)` to correctly restrict products to those at or below the specified maximum price. All unit tests (`DemoApplicationTests`) now pass successfully.",
